// rbi-payments — Reserve Bank of India, Storage of Payment System Data
// (directive of 6 April 2018)
//
// The law: all data relating to payment systems operated in India must be
// stored only in India.
//
// This pack: everything runs in India, on offers with a contract and an
// audit (T2 or better).
//
// Use `import "rbi-payments"`. Not legal advice.

policy rbi-payments {
  residency = india
  min_trust = T2
}
